  "bug_info": "Summary of configuration for Project: Math\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Script dir: /root/defects4j/framework\n      Base dir: /root/defects4j\n    Major root: /root/defects4j/major\n      Repo dir: /root/defects4j/project_repos\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Project ID: Math\n       Program: commons-math\n    Build file: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/Math.build.xml\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n           Vcs: Vcs::Git\n    Repository: /root/defects4j/project_repos/commons-math.git\n     Commit db: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/active-bugs.csv\nNumber of bugs: 106\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSummary for Bug: Math-71\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision ID (fixed version):\n061f50175cf7047856a934f9a827dbe6fd818334\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision date (fixed version):\n2010-03-24 22:11:51 +0000\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report id:\nMATH-358\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report url:\nhttps://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MATH-358\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRoot cause in triggering tests:\n - org.apache.commons.math.ode.nonstiff.ClassicalRungeKuttaIntegratorTest::testMissedEndEvent\n   --> junit.framework.AssertionFailedError: expected:<1.8782503799999986E9> but was:<1.878250439999994E9>\n - org.apache.commons.math.ode.nonstiff.DormandPrince853IntegratorTest::testMissedEndEvent\n   --> junit.framework.AssertionFailedError: expected:<1.8782503799999986E9> but was:<1.878250479999994E9>\n-----------------------------------------------